{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shuteye is a first-person psychological horror game that blurs the line between reality and delusion.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark, a troubled writer trapped in his memories from the past. Isolated within his home, paranoia grows with every slight disturbance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home that should feel familiar twists into something far more sinister as someone enters uninvited.<i>\u00a0An entity lurks in the dark. It hears your every move. </i>Stay quiet and move swiftly as you collect items and search for a way out, uncovering fragments of your past along the way.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, escape is never what it seems. The more you explore, the more you\u2019ll question whats real\u2026<i> and what your mind wanted you to believe.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800060?t=1757610260","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3800060?t=1757610260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800060/a7d73a279157baf2eb1b00a764a0b3eaf8a9309c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757610260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800060/a7d73a279157baf2eb1b00a764a0b3eaf8a9309c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757610260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains depictions of depression, addiction, assault, and suicide, and may not be suitable for all audiences. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shuteye is a first-person psychological horror game that blurs the line between reality and delusion.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark, a troubled writer trap